          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309420632277737
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Choisir la premi\xE8re option.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"a6e1ffc5e1b18699ca59d2c39910692764055c26a49e5089a7f10e7bb0fdd93f\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
