          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595918735
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Importation de {setName}...","status":"machine","sourceHash":"e6e3a80ef2c9706d54487a68e5b769d5444c580920614b06d9c13518a3e6b2bd","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919190
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"S\xE9lectionner : clic gauche sur une carte ou
          {move}.\\nD\xE9placer une carte : glissez avec le bouton gauche, ou utilisez
          {page} avec une carte s\xE9lectionn\xE9e.\\nD\xE9placer la vue : glissez
          avec le bouton central ou Maj+bouton gauche, ou utilisez {page}.\\nZoomer
          : Ctrl+molette, ou {toggle} pour activer le zoom avec {page}.\\nTourner
          : Ctrl+glisser avec le bouton droit, ou {toggle} pour activer la rotation
          avec {page}.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"fdafb77ffa0cd274a994e7561ae0efce6b4696dd4ff57f3ded6bf5881f8eaefc\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919191
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"S\xE9lectionner : touchez une carte.\\nVoir :
          maintenez une carte appuy\xE9e pour l\u2019agrandir.\\nD\xE9placer une
          carte : faites-la glisser avec un doigt.\\nD\xE9placer la vue : faites
          glisser la zone de jeu avec deux doigts.\\nZoomer : pincez avec deux doigts.\\nTourner
          : pivotez avec deux doigts si la rotation est activ\xE9e.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"8cd61d7150b526f4c683276db7e794318884368e3ccf83ec332813dcd398d40d\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919192
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Compteur : {value}","status":"machine","sourceHash":"c5675b5a6455c2ca233e27a68e14d77623dae5be8d57ebf69b56a5db48b5bd0b","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919193
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Valeur : {value} / Max : {max}","status":"machine","sourceHash":"fbfac67ab035dabf7bd12836a36812c49de366d1fc39f1cdd5666b72487c60aa","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919194
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Le navigateur n\u2019a pas pu copier le texte.
          R\xE9essayez sur une page HTTPS avec un navigateur compatible et v\xE9rifiez
          les autorisations du presse-papiers.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"6cf35631d7b766f365c42ee63a8839394ecbb106db018d6ac42be6587604e6fb\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919195
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Partage annul\xE9 ou non termin\xE9.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"b2eac93fb69971c61fe3389cb6d8940a42f01383a65bff494661df3a12adea4b\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919196
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Copi\xE9 dans le presse-papiers.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"cda98707b1a1fbbbe00d30b4a3a7e3d58dde6dfc18135788a13d7389b301072f\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919197
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Impossible de copier dans le presse-papiers.
          R\xE9essayez.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"d5a2d95e0c19fcc0d2340e70307aae6bc0f3c46ad34ed35b9d7563a8774743fd\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919198
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Impossible de confirmer la copie. Essayez de
          coller pour v\xE9rifier, ou copiez \xE0 nouveau.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"bb1dc1527229f23ae387371aa5fd8ad88f52b8dd07628ed26cd87e9049c5a700\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919199
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Le texte de ce deck a \xE9t\xE9 copi\xE9 dans
          le presse-papiers.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"759c0a0d827331d2b4b1686b9d1f785656ee6a8cae900c7bd1350ec179b74238\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919200
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Destination s\xE9lectionn\xE9e. V\xE9rifiez-y
          que le contenu a bien \xE9t\xE9 partag\xE9 ou copi\xE9.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"eb3f6505ec2a8b8c2855caa3d54c05172f5ffa0c1f14d6e661e37a52ae94232b\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919201
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Aucun texte \xE0 copier ou \xE0 partager.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"cc01f4d7753ebfc4e9841cd67af5f40c6503c19319e616a804d10573949b35f2\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919202
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Impossible d\u2019ouvrir le partage. R\xE9essayez.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"79e37518e7b4bd4034f8e9844735c4921bf394f24f4daa4906c8a0310f724beb\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919203
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Impossible de pr\xE9parer le fichier \xE0 partager.
          R\xE9essayez.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"77db2fbf049a38f3c79356df057bb63492ccd8a0bac5316de453dee641755464\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919204
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Fichier \xE0 partager introuvable. Exportez-le
          \xE0 nouveau, puis r\xE9essayez.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"bcc2d484d49fdc8c48b94074fd63e6dbcd431b1b2565154114d8b1d2be899c92\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919205
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Identifiant/IP du salon copi\xE9 dans le presse-papiers.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"c91b811b49a2fe49fdaedbe05aa28c6eda0460e583c6517b349877b9737ff156\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919206
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Le partage n\u2019est pas disponible sur cette
          plateforme.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"d6c9ecb4060b5e92f4d68636267c5717617cd30f608d65acf4552f73590060af\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919207
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Le partage s\u2019est ferm\xE9. Impossible de
          confirmer que le contenu a \xE9t\xE9 partag\xE9 ou copi\xE9.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"45ce66249278db915687842739719753130c178e5c3a23af786b47082f645dbf\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309421595919208
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Bienvenue dans CGS !\nLe site CGS propose des guides
          et des ressources pour les nouveaux utilisateurs.\nOuvrir le site CGS ?","status":"machine","sourceHash":"6ebc31ac05e2fe242d8efb95bf836827997ff3eb24af91dfb68a52de41006641","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309421595919209
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Bienvenue dans CGS !\nCette version mobile accompagne
          la version PC de CGS, disponible sur le site CGS.\nOuvrir le site CGS ?","status":"machine","sourceHash":"7b4d3ea637051f0761b5897e0d4e30858dac7559a3f81a1530d0b3409307b312","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309422095302656
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"#Collez ici le code du deck","status":"machine","sourceHash":"8ff58d46843bbda8a99b5e18968d1b67f8273d16db05f72f25b374da5b07f9dc","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309422095302657
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"//Sur chaque ligne, saisissez :\\n//<Quantit\xE9>
          <Nom de carte>\\n//Par exemple :\\n4 Super Awesome Card\\n3 Less Awesome
          Card I Still Like\\n1 Card That Is Situational\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"fd707523743e8eb5e2bbbcc2fe1138d175e0112b484b6df4dc372eb50fb9694e\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302658
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"### Instructions\\n#Sur chaque ligne, saisissez
          :\\n#<Quantit\xE9> <Nom de carte>\\n#Par exemple :\\n4 Super Awesome Card\\n3
          Less Awesome Card I Still Like\\n1 Card That Is Situational\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"270629432bf2d3111509709bab831e007426cf604edd8bd6db7aec6024377d2e\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302659
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"#Sur chaque ligne, saisissez <Identifiant de
          carte>\\n#Copier/coller recommand\xE9\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"43e1f3c13cb204cd956c26e2880c4f90c1fc0f2d74de517cf7479efe1c2e2950\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302660
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"L\u2019image de {name} ({id}) est trop volumineuse.
          Supprimez la carte, compressez l\u2019image avec un outil tel que https://www.iloveimg.com/compress-image,
          puis importez-la \xE0 nouveau.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"5c57d9f839f6d60e2e3eaa2a3ddb1f230a241406d1e831a3db5883508d228dd6\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302661
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Attention : le type du fichier image ne correspond
          pas \xE0 {extension}.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"57913e896fdf4a85f3a3feb37c3e14f33e31bbed9e7335f47a1a3e86ae94e3fe\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302662
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Impossible de d\xE9poser une carte sur une autre
          en dehors de la zone de jeu.\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"0b368a2edce6f6dbe8da1760116eaef598c20cfc9f5529b342f829bb2c81ada7\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302739
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Effacer la trace","status":"machine","sourceHash":"600fdda9f69f2ae479591af129bef1328a6608691be981e63a76b2aa625255a2","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309422095302740
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: '{"text":"Exporter la trace","status":"machine","sourceHash":"4e7e2d16ca5ad44333742acce4f77433a76a113db1bbc340c4f9a5a04f356134","provenance":{"method":"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary","date":"2026-10-05"}}'
    - rid: 7133309422095302741
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Marquer / instantan\xE9\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"ad95d7d96ab9a01532e93d09aabea4c8240198cb0840f9c17c7275b40ad5d07d\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302742
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Trace r\xE9seau : Client {id}\\n{count}/{total}
          \xE9v\xE9nements\",\"status\":\"machine\",\"sourceHash\":\"51f40e54ce9cd57a8616b8a5c775b8a216341a9eafac271910277daad8b5fa96\",\"provenance\":{\"method\":\"Codex
          contextual machine draft; English context and CGS glossary\",\"date\":\"2026-10-05\"}}"
    - rid: 7133309422095302743
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "{\"text\":\"Trace r\xE9seau : H\xF4te {id}\\n{count}/{total}
